# The LibreChat BFF is a genuinely separate deployable (own image, ADR-042 §5
# Option A) with its own minimal dependency set. Exact pins here; the hashed
# lock bff/requirements.txt is compiled constrained by the server's
# requirements.txt (-c) so the shared libraries resolve to the SAME versions
# in both images. Bumped only by `make lock-upgrade` (Dependabot covers `/` only).
